I wake up early.
It is only six o'clock.
It is a new day.
I get up slowly.
I walk over to the window.
I look out at the city.
It is still dark and cold outside.
Winter is still here.
I go into the bathroom.
I wash my face.
I brush my teeth.
Then I get dressed.
I put on a thick, warm sweater.
It is perfect for a cold day.
I go into the kitchen.
I make a cup of warm coffee.
I eat a slice of bread with cheese.
Now I am completely awake.
I am ready for the new day.
